#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-lte-telem.rst:5
#: 7c37a3e709404c1a93acad1c28c3f648
msgid "BlueOS 4G/LTE Telemetry Setup"
msgstr "BlueOS 4G/LTE 数传设置"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-lte-telem.rst:7
#: 6fff70934416484a97d29deb043722f0
msgid ""
"This page explains how to install and configure a 4G/LTE telemetry module "
"for use with BlueOS assuming :ref:`this setup <companion-computer-blueos-"
"install>` has already been completed.  These instructions were originally "
"posted on `this blog post <https://discuss.ardupilot.org/t/bluerobotics-"
"vehicle-lte-for-japan/112359>`__"
msgstr ""
"本页说明如何在已完成 :ref:`此设置 <companion-computer-blueos-install>` 的基础上，安装和配置 4G/LTE "
"数传模块以配合 BlueOS 使用。本说明最初发布于 `此博客文章 "
"<https://discuss.ardupilot.org/t/bluerobotics-vehicle-lte-for-"
"japan/112359>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-lte-telem.rst:9
#: d74db31b9d48476681f7fcbc6f28d033
msgid ""
"`BlueOS's official wiki is here "
"<https://blueos.cloud/docs/latest/usage/overview/>`__"
msgstr ""
"`BlueOS 官方 wiki 请见此处 <https://blueos.cloud/docs/latest/usage/overview/>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-lte-telem.rst:12
#: ab4499fc71e643fea8f4cb478c06ca28
msgid "Recommended Hardware"
msgstr "推荐硬件"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-lte-telem.rst:18
#: 31c5b5185f4b4b52a91a2392a835f038
msgid ""
"LTE modem compatible with RPi and capable of IPv4 (but not IPv6).  Known "
"working modems include:"
msgstr "与 RPi 兼容且支持 IPv4（不支持 IPv6）的 LTE 调制解调器。已知可用的调制解调器包括："

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-lte-telem.rst:20
#: 660f73e94485459ea741f417186b4a5c
msgid ""
"`FujiSoft FS040U LTE (Japan) "
"<https://www.amazon.co.jp/gp/product/B08H824QN7?psc=1>`__"
msgstr ""
"`FujiSoft FS040U LTE（日本） "
"<https://www.amazon.co.jp/gp/product/B08H824QN7?psc=1>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-lte-telem.rst:21
#: 5ff5b0f90c774f46863195032ce91f86
msgid ""
"`Quectel LTE EC25 Mini PCIe <https://www.quectel.com/product/lte-ec25-mini-"
"pcie-series/>`__"
msgstr ""
"`Quectel LTE EC25 Mini PCIe <https://www.quectel.com/product/lte-ec25-mini-"
"pcie-series/>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-lte-telem.rst:23
#: 014e69cfbb0e40e7a2568c0b82905eff
msgid ""
"A compatible SIM card like those from `IIJmio in Japan "
"<https://www.iijmio.jp/>`__ or  `Hologram <https://www.hologram.io/>`__"
msgstr ""
"兼容的 SIM 卡，例如 `日本 IIJmio <https://www.iijmio.jp/>`__ 或 `Hologram "
"<https://www.hologram.io/>`__ 提供的 SIM 卡"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-lte-telem.rst:24
#: 5fdb29c187884ff0a2b219140e7e6b87
msgid ""
"Custom cable to connect the `Ochin Tiny Carrier Board V2 "
"<https://www.seeedstudio.com/Ochin-Tiny-Carrier-Board-V2-for-Raspberry-Pi-"
"CM4-p-5887.html>`__ to the 4G/LTE modem"
msgstr ""
"用于将 `Ochin Tiny Carrier Board V2 <https://www.seeedstudio.com/Ochin-Tiny-"
"Carrier-Board-V2-for-Raspberry-Pi-CM4-p-5887.html>`__ 连接到 4G/LTE 调制解调器的定制线缆"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-lte-telem.rst:27
#: 27a400cad511444198d789c52e9fc1f8
msgid "Check Internet Connectivity"
msgstr "检查互联网连接"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-lte-telem.rst:29
#: 7fb98a7e40074df5aead00a4f8ff7147
msgid ""
"Power on the vehicle and wait a few minutes for BlueOS to start and for the "
"modem to connect to the 4G/LTE network"
msgstr "给飞行器上电，等待几分钟使 BlueOS 启动并让调制解调器连接到 4G/LTE 网络"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-lte-telem.rst:30
#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-lte-telem.rst:59
#: 33612119f8ba44e6a1fefd3885573710 dd5f5045047541ba92f7d7da3342e59a
msgid ""
"On the PC open a Chrome browser to http://blueos-avahi.local/ (BlueOS should"
" appear)"
msgstr "在 PC 上，用 Chrome 浏览器打开 http://blueos-avahi.local/（BlueOS 界面应会出现）"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-lte-telem.rst:31
#: 2ad795f93c76432badedf7dc1d06e6d1
msgid ""
"From the top right menu select the Networking icon, look for \"usb1\" and "
"confirm it is using \"Dynamic IP\""
msgstr "从右上角菜单选择网络图标，找到「usb1」并确认其使用「动态 IP」"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-lte-telem.rst:37
#: 4751a459e14c45b983875f5926f56e4d
msgid ""
"From the top right menu select the globe icon and confirm \"usb\" shows a "
"green globe meaning internet is available"
msgstr "从右上角菜单选择地球图标，确认「usb」显示绿色地球，表示互联网可用"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-lte-telem.rst:38
#: 17552e359e8940998d9e818b7c9e6192
msgid ""
"Optionally change the priority of 4G/LTE vs wifi by changing the order of "
"\"usb\" and \"wlan\" in the list"
msgstr "可选地通过更改列表中「usb」和「wlan」的顺序来调整 4G/LTE 与 WiFi 的优先级"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-lte-telem.rst:45
#: 3c6ccb2b4b6840fc862721f5f82da155
msgid "ZeroTier Setup Part 1"
msgstr "ZeroTier 设置第一部分"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-lte-telem.rst:47
#: a0ae42f584454e5c9644807648046a2a
msgid "Create a ZeroTier account (see https://www.zerotier.com/)"
msgstr "创建 ZeroTier 账户（参见 https://www.zerotier.com/）"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-lte-telem.rst:48
#: 997b7ac7fc444a7d9645c0f703fc8a09
msgid "Create a new ZeroTier network, record the Network ID"
msgstr "创建新的 ZeroTier 网络，记录网络 ID"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-lte-telem.rst:49
#: 7d62c40a4f36418fa8507659ed9479a8
msgid "On the PC:"
msgstr "在 PC 上："

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-lte-telem.rst:51
#: 748aff608bca4f358e0224899b260645
msgid "`Install ZeroTier <https://www.zerotier.com/download/>`__"
msgstr "`安装 ZeroTier <https://www.zerotier.com/download/>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-lte-telem.rst:53
#: 301de047c1344d0fa47b60ab073f81aa
msgid "Start the ZeroTier App"
msgstr "启动 ZeroTier 应用"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-lte-telem.rst:54
#: ee85736fb98f4d46a201e34792be1270
msgid ""
"On bottom right tray, select orange ZeroTier icon, Join new network, paste "
"in the Network ID"
msgstr "在右下角托盘，选择橙色 ZeroTier 图标，加入新网络，粘贴网络 ID"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-lte-telem.rst:57
#: 12500459b3fb475eb631127ed13d0484
msgid "BlueOS Setup"
msgstr "BlueOS 设置"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-lte-telem.rst:60
#: 64cad1d1b28449268a1fe98148880a45
msgid ""
"From left menu select Extensions, find ZeroTier and push the \"Get\" button "
"(installation will take a few minutes)"
msgstr "从左侧菜单选择「扩展」，找到 ZeroTier 并点击「获取」按钮（安装需要几分钟）"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-lte-telem.rst:61
#: 57c113c165dd4a4d9b28e527d327b059
msgid ""
"From left menu select ZeroTier Manager, in the “Network ID\" field enter the"
" Network ID recorded above and push “Join”"
msgstr "从左侧菜单选择「ZeroTier 管理器」，在「网络 ID」字段中输入上述记录的网络 ID，并点击「加入」"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-lte-telem.rst:62
#: 7285e885cd294bb9b63c1764b1187552
msgid "Enable MAVLink Server:"
msgstr "启用 MAVLink 服务器："

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-lte-telem.rst:64
#: 31f9ee3fd15b485f874c825f84583f98
msgid ""
"From top right menu click on the Pirate mode icon (smiling Buddha face), "
"Enable Pirate Mode"
msgstr "从右上角菜单点击海盗模式图标（笑脸佛头），启用海盗模式"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-lte-telem.rst:65
#: 3916a310bfa84700991d3a7c94ec8749
msgid "From left menu select “MAVLink Endpoints”"
msgstr "从左侧菜单选择「MAVLink 端点」"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-lte-telem.rst:66
#: 110b6f0b785a4daca3bcfcead4fa6776
msgid ""
"Find the “GCS Server Link” section and ensure the blue slider is to the "
"right"
msgstr "找到「GCS 服务器链接」部分，确保蓝色滑块在右侧（已启用）"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-lte-telem.rst:69
#: 55d7b30e73f44d1b80bbf037d677fb37
msgid "ZeroTier Setup Part 2"
msgstr "ZeroTier 设置第二部分"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-lte-telem.rst:71
#: 983a1e27ff1b42a2838ffea211170c01
msgid ""
"From a web browser, open `zerotier.com <https://www.zerotier.com/>`__ and "
"\"Log In\".  The browser should automatically forward to "
"https://my.zerotier.com/"
msgstr ""
"在浏览器中打开 `zerotier.com <https://www.zerotier.com/>`__ 并「登录」。浏览器应自动跳转至 "
"https://my.zerotier.com/"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-lte-telem.rst:72
#: 7541e2fcf4554638aefd16a455490b96
msgid "From the list of Networks, select the Network created in \"Part 1\" above"
msgstr "在网络列表中，选择上文「第一部分」中创建的网络"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-lte-telem.rst:73
#: 94f5e3e72d6b4d35ac291bb89e0f486a
msgid ""
"Scroll down to the “Members” area, and look for new entries corresponding to"
" the PC and vehicle"
msgstr "向下滚动到「成员」区域，查找对应 PC 和飞行器的新条目"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-lte-telem.rst:74
#: 9a3f1b527c2c41f0a31399d3aaa905e2
msgid ""
"Check the “Auth?” column for each, then click on the \"Edit\" column and "
"fill in the \"Name\" field"
msgstr "勾选每条记录的「授权？」列，然后点击「编辑」列并填写「名称」字段"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-lte-telem.rst:75
#: de1c49df5a8742dab6570e2ff7d721a5
msgid ""
"Optionally also change the \"IP Assignments\" field's last digit to an easy-"
"to-remember value between 1 and 255"
msgstr "可选地将「IP 分配」字段的最后一位数字更改为 1 到 255 之间易于记忆的值"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-lte-telem.rst:76
#: a1a3bd2a39024d668bf331cb577aa039
msgid "Copy the vehicle's \"Managed IP\" address (it will be needed below)"
msgstr "复制飞行器的「托管 IP」地址（后续步骤需要使用）"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-lte-telem.rst:79
#: 5929baa564844003abcc56210ca98039
msgid "Connecting with Mission Planner"
msgstr "使用 Mission Planner 连接"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-lte-telem.rst:81
#: 8407d9bd506e4f79b4439a2d22ee9675
msgid "Ensure PC has internet access"
msgstr "确保 PC 能访问互联网"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-lte-telem.rst:82
#: be075a3960d24b63a7bf8e0722eb0876
msgid "Start the ZeroTier App, from the bottom right tray, connect to network"
msgstr "启动 ZeroTier 应用，从右下角托盘连接到网络"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-lte-telem.rst:83
#: 14996ec7468146099820c369329ae123
msgid ""
"Open a web browser and enter the vehicle's IP address (see above), BlueOS "
"should appear"
msgstr "打开浏览器，输入飞行器 IP 地址（见上文），BlueOS 界面应会出现"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-lte-telem.rst:84
#: 1b56a49a109049688cf9395155b0165f
msgid ""
"Open Mission Planner, it should automatically connect. If it does not, from "
"top-right drop-down select UDPCI, enter the vehicle's IP address, port:14550"
msgstr ""
"打开 Mission Planner，应会自动连接。如未自动连接，从右上角下拉菜单选择 UDPCI，输入飞行器 IP 地址，端口：14550"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-lte-telem.rst:87
#: 73461fcf16624f168f9e3ebbe7971341
msgid "Connecting with QGC"
msgstr "使用 QGC 连接"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-lte-telem.rst:89
#: e78193a5282b45ae81f3f8df90d2acf6
msgid ""
"Use the same procedure as Mission Planner but if QGC does not automatically "
"connect"
msgstr "步骤与 Mission Planner 相同，但如果 QGC 未自动连接"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-lte-telem.rst:91
#: 229dcdf34fb245c9b475afd2895f9038
msgid "Select top-left icon, Application Settings, Comm Links"
msgstr "选择左上角图标、应用设置、通信链路"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-lte-telem.rst:92
#: f4a3e57c41fa493fb13fdb4ae3fa36af
msgid ""
"Add, Name: vehicle, Type:UDP, Port:14550, Server Address:, Add Server, OK"
msgstr "添加，名称：vehicle，类型：UDP，端口：14550，服务器地址：，添加服务器，确定"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-lte-telem.rst:95
#: 57e450f5be8642c689fd8e7403dcad6d
msgid "Connecting with Cockpit"
msgstr "使用 Cockpit 连接"

#: ../../source/docs/companion-computer-blueos-lte-telem.rst:97
#: efd15a88831a4e0c8244f2a2acfc3265
msgid ""
"Alternatively the BlueOS's built-in GCS, Cockpit, can be used by opening a "
"Chrome browser, entering the vehicle's IP address into the URL and once "
"BlueOS appears, select Cockpit from the left menu"
msgstr ""
"也可使用 BlueOS 内置地面站 Cockpit，打开 Chrome 浏览器，在 URL 中输入飞行器 IP 地址，BlueOS 出现后从左侧菜单选择"
" Cockpit"
